 "highlights": [
  "Discover Hanoi, the capital city of Vietnam, where the rich history and cultural heritage of the country come together to create an unforgettable experience.",
  "Visit the stunning Ngoc Son Temple, where the legendary tale of the Golden Turtle and magic sword unfolds against the serene backdrop of Hoan Kiem Lake.",
  "Explore Bat Trang Village, where you can witness traditional pottery-making firsthand, create your own masterpiece, and shop for beautifully crafted ceramics unique to Hanoi.",
  "Wander at Hoa Lo Prison, known as the \"Hanoi Hilton,\" where you can learn about the haunting history and struggles of prisoners of Vietnam War through various exhibits.",
  "Step into Temple of Literature, where the country’s first university still stands, and take a glimpse into the unique Confucian learning and the scholarly traditions of the past."
 ],
 "overview": "About the Tour:\nVietnam, a country known for its rich history and vibrant culture. On this tour, you will explore the vibrant capital of Vietnam, Hanoi. Explore attractions like Ngoc Son Temple on Hoan Kiem Lake, connected by the charming Huc Bridge, offering insights into the city’s spiritual heritage. Also, cover the Temple of Literature, Vietnam's first university, founded in 1070, symbolizing Confucian learning and tradition, among some major attractions. Don't miss this tour, as it covers the experiences of Hanoi’s historical, cultural, and artistic legacy through these carefully selected sites.",
